# iMaker Restro

> iMaker Restro is an all-in-one restaurant POS and management platform built for restaurants, cafes, bakeries, QSRs, fine-dining businesses, food courts, bars, hotels, franchises, and multi-outlet restaurant businesses.

iMaker Restro brings restaurant billing, order management, table management, menu management, inventory, kitchen operations, customer management, shift management, reports and analytics, and multi-branch management together in one connected platform.

The platform is designed to help restaurant owners and teams manage daily operations from a single system while providing additional tools for ordering, kitchen workflows, customer engagement, purchasing, recipes, analytics, and other restaurant-specific requirements.

