## Core Features

iMaker Restro provides a connected set of restaurant management capabilities covering front-of-house, back-of-house, inventory, customers, reporting, and multi-outlet operations.

- [Restaurant Billing](https://imakerrestro.com/features/restaurant-billing): Restaurant POS billing for managing bills and day-to-day billing workflows.

- [Restaurant Order Management](https://imakerrestro.com/features/restaurant-order-management): Manage restaurant orders and coordinate order workflows across the operation.

- [Restaurant Table Management](https://imakerrestro.com/features/restaurant-table-management): Manage restaurant tables and organize dine-in operations.

- [Restaurant Menu Management](https://imakerrestro.com/features/restaurant-menu-management): Create and manage restaurant menus, items, pricing, and menu-related information.

- [Restaurant Inventory Management](https://imakerrestro.com/features/restaurant-inventory-management): Manage restaurant inventory, stock, and related inventory operations.

- [Restaurant Kitchen Management](https://imakerrestro.com/features/restaurant-kitchen-management): Manage kitchen operations and coordinate orders between service and kitchen teams.

- [Restaurant Customer Management](https://imakerrestro.com/features/restaurant-customer-management): Manage customer information and customer-related restaurant operations.

- [Restaurant Shift Management](https://imakerrestro.com/features/restaurant-shift-management): Manage restaurant staff shifts and shift-related operational activity.

- [Restaurant Reports & Analytics](https://imakerrestro.com/features/restaurant-reports-analytics): Access restaurant reports and analytics to understand sales, operations, and business performance.

- [Restaurant Multi-Branch Management](https://imakerrestro.com/features/restaurant-multi-branch-management): Manage multiple restaurant branches or outlets through a connected restaurant management system.

## Restaurant POS Add-ons

iMaker Restro can be extended with additional restaurant-focused tools and add-ons for ordering, kitchen operations, customer engagement, analytics, purchasing, recipes, and other workflows.

- [Captain Ordering App](https://imakerrestro.com/addons/captain-ordering-app): Mobile ordering tools for restaurant captains and service staff.

- [QR Ordering](https://imakerrestro.com/addons/scan-and-order): QR-based ordering that allows restaurant customers to access ordering workflows from their devices.

- [Kitchen Display System](https://imakerrestro.com/addons/kitchen-display-system): Digital kitchen display and order workflow management for restaurant kitchen teams.

- [Restaurant Loyalty Program](https://imakerrestro.com/addons/restaurant-loyalty-program): Customer loyalty tools designed to support restaurant customer retention and engagement.

- [Restaurant Analytics & Insights](https://imakerrestro.com/addons/restaurant-analytics-insights): Additional analytics and insights for understanding restaurant performance.

- [Event & Catering Management](https://imakerrestro.com/addons/event-and-catering-management): Tools for managing restaurant events and catering-related operations.

- [Restaurant Messaging](https://imakerrestro.com/addons/restaurant-messaging): Messaging capabilities for restaurant customer and operational communication.

- [Purchase Management](https://imakerrestro.com/addons/purchase-management): Manage restaurant purchasing and procurement workflows.

- [Recipe Management](https://imakerrestro.com/addons/recipe-management): Manage restaurant recipes and recipe-related operational information.

