## Platform & Device Compatibility

iMaker Restro is designed to work across major operating systems and restaurant devices.

Supported operating systems include:

- Android
- iOS
- Windows
- macOS

Supported device categories include:

- Android mobile POS devices
- Android POS terminals
- Tablets
- Desktop computers
- Laptops

Printer compatibility includes:

- Bluetooth thermal printers
- USB thermal printers
- Network / IP / LAN thermal printers

Supported restaurant printing workflows include customer bills, KOTs, receipts, duplicate bills, and other restaurant documents where supported by the product configuration.

## Restaurant Operations

iMaker Restro is designed around the operational workflow of restaurants.

Typical areas of restaurant management covered by the platform include:

- Billing and point of sale
- Order processing
- Dine-in table operations
- Menu management
- Kitchen workflows
- Inventory and stock management
- Purchasing
- Recipe management
- Customer management
- Staff and shift operations
- Reports and analytics
- Multi-outlet management
- Customer ordering and engagement through supported add-ons

